IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. TRANSACTION-RECONCILIATION.

DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.

01 N              PIC 9(6).
01 I              PIC 9(6).
01 LEDGER-AMOUNT  PIC 9(15).
01 LEDGER-TOTAL   PIC 9(18) VALUE 0.
01 EXPECTED-TOTAL PIC 9(18).
01 DIFF           PIC S9(18).

01 DISPLAY-TOTAL  PIC Z(17)9.
01 DISPLAY-DIFF   PIC Z(17)9.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.

ACCEPT N


PERFORM VARYING I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL I > N
ACCEPT LEDGER-AMOUNT
ADD LEDGER-AMOUNT TO LEDGER-TOTAL
END-PERFORM

ACCEPT EXPECTED-TOTAL

COMPUTE DIFF = LEDGER-TOTAL - EXPECTED-TOTAL

MOVE LEDGER-TOTAL TO DISPLAY-TOTAL

DISPLAY "Ledger total: " FUNCTION TRIM(DISPLAY-TOTAL)

IF DIFF = 0
    DISPLAY "MATCH"
ELSE
    IF DIFF < 0
        MOVE FUNCTION ABS(DIFF) TO DISPLAY-DIFF
        DISPLAY "Difference: -" FUNCTION TRIM(DISPLAY-DIFF)
    ELSE
        MOVE DIFF TO DISPLAY-DIFF
        DISPLAY "Difference: " FUNCTION TRIM(DISPLAY-DIFF)
    END-IF
END-IF

STOP RUN.